invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_cfg.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the TRUST=webpki pin rule reads only the two server_pubkey
  pointers, so a config that sets server_pubkey_len or
  server_pubkey2_len alone passes as a chain config, and a provisioning
  mistake that dropped a pin goes unreported.
  bin/webpki_session_test's length-only rows object.

--- old
    return cfg->server_pubkey == NULL && cfg->server_pubkey_len == 0 &&
           cfg->server_pubkey2 == NULL && cfg->server_pubkey2_len == 0;
--- new
    return cfg->server_pubkey == NULL && cfg->server_pubkey2 == NULL;
